# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Secrets. `*.local` above already covers .env.local, but a plain .env or .env.production
# would otherwise be committed — and once a Gmail app password is in git history, deleting
# the file does not remove it.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

